## Project Structure

```
model-bench-cli/
├── docs/
│   ├── REQUIREMENTS.md          # Software Requirements Specification
│   ├── ARCHITECTURE.md          # System Architecture & DB Schema
│   └── USER_GUIDE.md            # Complete CLI usage guide
├── src/
│   └── model_bench/
│       ├── __init__.py          # Package version
│       ├── cli.py               # Entry point & subcommand routing
│       ├── client.py            # HTTP client & JSON normalizer
│       ├── db.py                # SQLite schema & analytical queries
│       ├── display.py           # Rich terminal rendering
│       └── exporter.py          # Markdown & CSV file export
├── tests/
│   ├── payload.json             # Offline sample payload fixture
│   └── test_normalizer.py       # 39 unit & integration tests
├── pyproject.toml               # Build config & entry point
└── README.md
```

