## Running Tests

```bash
pip install pytest
python -m pytest tests/ -v
```

---

## Data Source

All model data is sourced from the **[OpenRouter API](https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/models)** (`GET /api/v1/models`), which provides an unauthenticated, public catalog of 460+ models across 50+ providers including OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta, DeepSeek, Mistral, and many more.

